Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最近在学校怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉良好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.65,0:00:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么感觉良好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:12.53,0:00:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾什么都没说\N我都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:15.19,0:00:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最近好像有喜欢的女孩了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:19.47,0:00:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.27,0:00:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧，慎吾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没听你说过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:24.54,0:00:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有什么好说的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.87,0:00:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁呀同班的女孩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同年级的纱纪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.95,0:00:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个可爱的纱纪吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:36.15,0:00:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别说呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.09,0:00:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害羞了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:40.55,0:00:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看中她的美貌了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.49,0:00:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢她的内在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.29,0:00:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告白了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.23,0:00:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.97,0:00:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾还是再成熟点比校好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也也这么想吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.51,0:01:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想再成熟点比较好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得够成熟了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.18,0:01:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了吗\N我都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自信过头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.52,0:01:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也不坏呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.39,0:01:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么罗曼史吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼史
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前有很多呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.60,0:01:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出来听听嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学生时代的故事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.80,0:01:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学生时代呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.61,0:01:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前没和同级生交往过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.81,0:01:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是和比我大的叔叔交往的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.75,0:01:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔怎么邂逅的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.95,0:01:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不告诉你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.89,0:01:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈很糟糕呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.89,0:01:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是很好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.49,0:01:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要在意啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.09,0:01:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前是这样的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.23,0:02:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也，你喜欢什么类型的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢什么类型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾不知道吗\N你们关系这么好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.84,0:02:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢蠢萌可爱的\N喜欢蠢萌可爱的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.25,0:02:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不觉得那种女孩麻烦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.79,0:02:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢萌的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.39,0:02:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢萌的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.46,0:02:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得很不错呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.86,0:02:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也说说你喜欢的类型嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.00,0:02:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都可以啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是喜欢大叔吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.14,0:02:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢那种色气满满的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.14,0:02:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种有点危险的男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.01,0:02:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸完全不是这种类型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.75,0:02:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨手笨脚的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么邂逅的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邂逅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子他爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.89,0:03:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里邂逅的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.36,0:03:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不告诉你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.43,0:03:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不能和孩子说的保密
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你再大点再说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很想听吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.98,0:03:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也你现在还没女朋友吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的分手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾完全不行呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.19,0:03:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没交过女朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.40,0:03:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骗人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.81,0:03:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妄想的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.94,0:03:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不和妈妈说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.48,0:03:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人类吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会和你说的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.89,0:04:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是担心你交不到女朋友呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么漂亮的妈妈真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也你真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没这回事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.77,0:04:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯什么嗯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也妈妈也很漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.04,0:04:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈不行啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.85,0:04:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也的妈妈也是个美人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别烦人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会觉得自己妈妈烦的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾也觉得我很烦人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.53,0:04:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要继续打扫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好好聊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.54,0:04:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和纱纪发展怎么样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没找她一起玩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连她联系方式都没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去问吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.16,0:05:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太让你妈担心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.16,0:05:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.70,0:05:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慎吾也要加油啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.85,0:05:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发什么呆呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.59,0:05:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近有什么有趣的事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.80,0:05:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么有趣的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校发生的趣事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.54,0:06:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.41,0:06:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纱纪和一个学长关系很好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么有趣的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.50,0:06:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纱纪和那个学长交往吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.97,0:06:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是快点问她的联系方式吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去问吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打听一下那个学长吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还是算了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.55,0:07:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候问纱纪吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.22,0:07:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来\N田中和纱纪关系还挺好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.83,0:07:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那去问问田中吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.53,0:08:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我和田中关系不好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你直接问纱纪吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.01,0:08:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接问有点难开口啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.75,0:08:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才交不到女朋友呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不是没女朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.69,0:08:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有在认真听我说话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.29,0:08:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有在听了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.51,0:08:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.51,0:08:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是直接去问她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个人有点不安\N你陪我去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.86,0:09:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.46,0:09:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人很奇怪诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.93,0:09:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就说三个人一起玩\N互相交换联系方式什么的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.41,0:09:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.41,0:09:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样显得自然一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.75,0:09:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很晚了\N我想睡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.35,0:09:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先去睡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.95,0:09:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去睡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.10,0:09:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不想睡呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.64,0:09:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被子都准备好了\N随时可以休息了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.91,0:10:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再收拾一下再睡觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真辛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.92,0:10:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你随便吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.40,0:10:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 拓也君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.94,0:10:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才直就在看着阿姨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我实在是忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你说什么呢\N放开我呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.35,0:10:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊 拓也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.69,0:10:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的 做这种事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太喜欢你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.84,0:10:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.91,0:11:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我实在是忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.57,0:11:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也你说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要摸呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.79,0:11:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.59,0:11:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乳头也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.60,0:11:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要挑逗乳头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:38.41,0:11:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.29,0:11:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧 求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.55,0:11:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢阿姨嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你这么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.63,0:11:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很困扰的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是阿姨的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.71,0:12:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 不能直接摸进去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.78,0:12:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 很害羞的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.45,0:12:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.59,0:12:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要摸啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.80,0:12:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好软啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也 不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你很久了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.58,0:13:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.05,0:13:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.93,0:13:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抑制不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.06,0:13:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么说\N我很困扰的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.43,0:14:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说不行的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.97,0:14:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股让我看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.66,0:14:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放过我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.41,0:14:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 那里很脏的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.75,0:15:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能舔那种地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很羞耻的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.45,0:15:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放过我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 真的不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这样舔啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.82,0:16:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓也舔得我好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.43,0:16:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能做这种事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.77,0:16:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.18,0:16:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.01,0:17:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你舔吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.31,0:17:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样行吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.51,0:17:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.85,0:17:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.79,0:17:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.15,0:18:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你让我看到乳头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.16,0:18:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是阿姨的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.07,0:19:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的乳头好淫荡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里舒服呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.31,0:20:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.25,0:20:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好负责
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.26,0:20:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你原谅我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.93,0:20:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐上来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要坐上去吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要插人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.95,0:20:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不行吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.06,0:22:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:44.54,0:22:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要插人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:44.60,0:23:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这么动啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.01,0:25:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:02.95,0:25:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:11.22,0:25:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:14.29,0:25:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:28.17,0:25:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能这么插啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:32.31,0:25:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:43.79,0:25:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:08.41,0:27:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:15.08,0:27:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:30.43,0:27:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:40.17,0:27:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:45.91,0:27:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:52.72,0:27:54.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:26.62,0:28:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:28.35,0:28:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:30.09,0:28:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:39.70,0:28:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:42.64,0:28:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨也好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:48.78,0:28:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要告诉慎吾哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:53.31,0:28:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:58.65,0:29:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你夫人真漂亮呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:00.92,0:29:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:01.85,0:29:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么认识的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:03.19,0:29:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚进公司的时候认识的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:06.26,0:29:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:07.86,0:29:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我公司可没这么漂亮的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:11.73,0:29:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那么忙连\N我的婚礼都没来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:14.80,0:29:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天第一次看到她吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:17.20,0:29:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 我其实很想参加的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:20.41,0:29:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很久没见了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:22.94,0:29:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:24.94,0:29:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行得很好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:26.55,0:29:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼服很适合你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:29.22,0:29:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也好想结婚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:31.62,0:29:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有喜欢的人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:33.89,0:29:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不好说也有没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:38.02,0:29:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃甜食吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:40.56,0:29:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:42.03,0:29:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:42.96,0:29:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用在意我啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:48.43,0:29:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 只有这个了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:50.84,0:29:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦 您费心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:52.44,0:29:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:55.51,0:29:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢巧克力了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:58.58,0:29:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:59.65,0:30:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还请多关照了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:01.78,0:30:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:02.45,0:30:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诚桑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:03.52,0:30:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫诚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:04.45,0:30:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:08.19,0:30:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很可爱呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:10.72,0:30:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可爱吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:12.46,0:30:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骄傲什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:14.59,0:30:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生赢家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:16.20,0:30:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全是人生赢家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:19.40,0:30:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在本人面前说有点害羞呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:26.21,0:30:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是大学时期的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:28.88,0:30:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 大学同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:31.94,0:30:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我邀请他参加我们婚礼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:35.95,0:30:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他工作太忙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:38.22,0:30:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:39.69,0:30:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遗憾啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:41.15,0:30:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是很久没见面了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:43.56,0:30:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:44.62,0:30:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学生时代经常一起玩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:46.36,0:30:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 每天在一起玩的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:47.96,0:30:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 关系真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:51.16,0:30:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大学的友谊很珍贵呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:54.63,0:30:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确呢 能延续下去很好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:02.64,0:31:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们你聊得来一些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:05.18,0:31:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去做家务了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:07.18,0:31:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:08.78,0:31:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好好招待他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:11.18,0:31:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:13.59,0:31:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:16.66,0:31:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:18.66,0:31:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要说什么吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:21.86,0:31:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人真可爱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:23.73,0:31:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还很年轻呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:27.07,0:31:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:35.21,0:31:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也快点结婚吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:37.74,0:31:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早点生个孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:43.35,0:31:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在听吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:44.55,0:31:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:47.75,0:31:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在听呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:51.76,0:31:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来喝茶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:54.43,0:31:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真难得呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:00.70,0:32:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过新出的电影了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:02.44,0:32:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近很流行的那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:04.70,0:32:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近人气很高呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:07.64,0:32:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好怀念啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:13.11,0:32:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去上个厕所
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:15.38,0:32:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所在那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:16.72,0:32:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:37.45,0:35:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诚桑 你怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:40.79,0:35:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:44.39,0:35:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:45.86,0:35:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没什么事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:47.86,0:35:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚后生活怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:50.13,0:35:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚后生活吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:53.33,0:35:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还算顺利吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:55.47,0:35:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:59.47,0:36:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是怎么邂逅的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:03.21,0:36:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邂逅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:05.61,0:36:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一起进公司的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:09.75,0:36:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始也没有喜欢他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:15.62,0:36:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们都是新人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:20.03,0:36:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉他特别可靠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:24.30,0:36:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉就爱上他了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:27.23,0:36:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:29.24,0:36:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是日久生情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:30.97,0:36:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:32.84,0:36:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那时候就这样想了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:38.31,0:36:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以好开心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:43.92,0:36:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对结婚有什么想法吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:50.19,0:36:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚计划什么的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:52.86,0:36:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:54.06,0:36:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没在听吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:57.26,0:36:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有计划结婚了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:59.00,0:37:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚的计划吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:01.40,0:37:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在也没什么计划呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:05.14,0:37:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:06.21,0:37:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:07.01,0:37:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:08.07,0:37:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所在外面呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:10.08,0:37:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走错地方了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:11.68,0:37:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:13.15,0:37:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点难找吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:14.35,0:37:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:15.28,0:37:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:18.48,0:37:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所你出门往左就到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:22.09,0:37:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才去过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:23.42,0:37:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:29.16,0:37:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去过厕所了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:33.57,0:37:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:37.17,0:37:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:40.24,0:37:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:42.38,0:37:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:44.91,0:37:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点担心你找不到厕所呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:50.12,0:37:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实也没什么啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:54.65,0:37:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N为什么站着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:57.32,0:37:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N你别在意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:01.73,0:38:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很在意呢\N身体不舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:04.80,0:38:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:06.67,0:38:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:12.94,0:38:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家也没那么大呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:18.95,0:38:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:21.75,0:38:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:22.95,0:38:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 我们买房的时候还纠结了很久呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:30.96,0:38:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选了很多房子呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:33.36,0:38:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很纠结呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:36.16,0:38:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:41.10,0:38:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次还要继续来玩哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:44.44,0:38:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:45.77,0:38:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很欢迎你来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:49.24,0:38:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我以后会常来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:53.11,0:38:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请务必要来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:57.25,0:39:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他向你求婚的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:02.05,0:39:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好害羞啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:04.59,0:39:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要聊这个话题吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:06.99,0:39:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不告诉我的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:11.80,0:39:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:15.00,0:39:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好害羞啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:17.54,0:39:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要说这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:20.21,0:39:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老公
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:24.61,0:39:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:26.48,0:39:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:29.28,0:39:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:30.08,0:39:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:32.62,0:39:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你冷静一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:35.56,0:39:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:42.63,0:39:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要开这种玩笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:45.70,0:39:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没戴胸晕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:49.30,0:39:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没戴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:53.17,0:39:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但问题不在这里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:56.38,0:39:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老公还在呢\N住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:01.18,0:40:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:03.18,0:40:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:06.92,0:40:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:08.65,0:40:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再开这种玩笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:18.53,0:40:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:21.60,0:40:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在住手还来得及
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:39.89,0:40:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:42.16,0:40:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样很奇怪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:10.58,0:41:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:13.25,0:41:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样很怪的\N是很怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:16.99,0:41:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:19.93,0:41:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:23.80,0:41:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老公还在呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:25.40,0:41:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样做的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:27.27,0:41:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就做不了朋友了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:29.54,0:41:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的我有觉悟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:33.01,0:41:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:35.41,0:41:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:08.84,0:43:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:10.70,0:43:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎么可能收手呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:43.67,0:43:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有感觉了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:46.87,0:43:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样是不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:56.62,0:43:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不讨厌吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:19.84,0:44:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再继续了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:08.29,0:45:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:18.43,0:45:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧 求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:34.71,0:45:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:59.93,0:48:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能被老公看到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:01.79,0:48:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会保密的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:07.00,0:48:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一下下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:32.23,0:48:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着就收手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:34.89,0:48:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:16.14,0:49:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你也很喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:19.74,0:49:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:26.95,0:49:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你口交完就结束吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:23.67,0:50:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 快拔出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:39.60,0:53:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 这样会坏掉的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:51.44,0:59:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:55.04,0:59:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说对不起有用吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:59.18,1:00:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会负责的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:00.78,1:00:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负什么责啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:03.58,1:00:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都射进来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:05.85,1:00:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:07.85,1:00:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:11.59,1:00:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:13.86,1:00:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样是没有意义的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:38.82,1:00:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:42.96,1:00:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全凭你你决定啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:46.56,1:00:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是想开始工作了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:51.36,1:00:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我父母想让我继续上学
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:55.77,1:00:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升学也挺好的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:00.17,1:01:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师你觉得怎么才好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:03.24,1:01:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按你的成绩升学很不错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:07.25,1:01:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:09.12,1:01:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:11.78,1:01:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是升学比较好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:15.79,1:01:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大学毕业后更好找工作吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:26.33,1:01:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我好迷茫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:28.60,1:01:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多选择
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:31.80,1:01:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间还多着呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:34.87,1:01:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好思考一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:38.61,1:01:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是去上班了\N就不能升学了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:44.08,1:01:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:45.95,1:01:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:47.95,1:01:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有特别想做的工作的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:53.03,1:01:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是升学比较好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:57.56,1:02:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过全凭你自己决定
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:01.57,1:02:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能提点建议
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:06.24,1:02:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母的意见参考一下就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:09.58,1:02:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想你自己想要什么吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:19.72,1:02:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多想想
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:21.85,1:02:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:26.26,1:02:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:29.46,1:02:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:33.20,1:02:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没注意到
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:41.34,1:02:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寻找自己想做的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:53.75,1:02:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么兴趣吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:56.56,1:02:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,件幺来着
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:02.56,1:03:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像有加入什么社团吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:06.83,1:03:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有加入的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:09.10,1:03:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美术社
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:11.77,1:03:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可以去画画呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:13.91,1:03:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为专业课吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:16.84,1:03:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有美术大学的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:21.51,1:03:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学习四年还有时间的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:35.53,1:03:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有听我说话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:37.66,1:03:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:44.07,1:03:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母说的也是有道理的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:53.41,1:03:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下个月有毕业讲座
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:57.28,1:03:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候再说吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:59.29,1:04:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:05.83,1:04:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:09.30,1:04:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉心不在焉的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:14.37,1:04:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师也没讲特别复杂的东西吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:17.44,1:04:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:25.98,1:04:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻时就该多想想
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:35.05,1:04:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然变安静了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:38.52,1:04:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有在听老师说话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:40.26,1:04:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有在听的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:46.93,1:04:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己的事情只有自己决定啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:49.87,1:04:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会考虑的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:54.54,1:04:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很困扰吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:56.81,1:04:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:59.35,1:05:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻人要多历练嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:05.49,1:05:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:07.35,1:05:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:08.29,1:05:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:11.76,1:05:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:16.96,1:05:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得出门了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:21.90,1:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自便吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:24.84,1:05:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出门了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:25.91,1:05:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路走好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:30.71,1:05:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 难得你来趟
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:33.11,1:05:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:35.11,1:05:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要打扫房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:38.32,1:05:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就慢慢坐吧\N我去打扫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:41.79,1:05:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:44.78,1:06:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:46.12,1:06:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:50.92,1:06:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊良君
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:53.33,1:06:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:54.26,1:06:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:57.06,1:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才就盯着你很久了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:01.73,1:07:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:04.14,1:07:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:07.07,1:07:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:20.95,1:07:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的 伊良君
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:38.84,1:07:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先冷静点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:41.24,1:07:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在诱惑我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:43.91,1:07:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:46.18,1:07:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么淫荡的内裤
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:57.39,1:07:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想错了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:02.46,1:08:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:09.00,1:08:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:11.00,1:08:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在诱惑我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:13.54,1:08:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:19.68,1:08:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:20.88,1:08:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:28.09,1:08:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能做这种事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:30.76,1:08:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师都出门了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:34.09,1:08:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许会回来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:35.29,1:08:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:36.50,1:08:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就结束的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:37.70,1:08:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么很快啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:39.17,1:08:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快结束的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:41.57,1:08:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种姿势\N很羞耻的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:49.18,1:08:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害羞吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:50.64,1:08:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然害羞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:53.58,1:08:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:10.13,1:09:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:12.80,1:09:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:24.94,1:09:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:10.99,1:10:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太兴奋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:14.33,1:10:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:18.20,1:10:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能感受到吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:19.53,1:10:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:30.61,1:10:33.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师也许马上就回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:34.08,1:10:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好兴奋啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:35.95,1:10:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在诱惑我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:37.95,1:10:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:13.19,1:11:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手都沾上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:16.26,1:11:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手吧\N很差耻的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:20.53,1:11:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也兴奋了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:23.20,1:11:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:25.87,1:11:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:40.55,1:11:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:17.71,1:13:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:19.58,1:13:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要摸那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:29.32,1:13:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实想要吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:33.73,1:13:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:43.74,1:13:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:40.05,1:16:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再继续了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:59.31,1:20:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好淫荡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:55.29,1:21:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个真的不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:27.19,1:22:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:28.39,1:22:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:33.33,1:22:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他回来了怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:35.74,1:22:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:52.02,1:22:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:48.13,1:24:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:49.87,1:24:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:56.28,1:24:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:24.04,1:25:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:57.40,1:25:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 那里不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:59.54,1:26:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:02.74,1:26:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:50.85,1:27:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:57.66,1:27:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能内射啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:59.26,1:28:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你拔出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:29.96,1:28:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射了这么多
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:48.11,1:28:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要告诉我老公
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:12.53,1:29:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:17.20,1:29:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪位呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:23.88,1:29:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本君
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:26.28,1:29:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近还好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:31.35,1:29:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又和女朋友吵架了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:39.49,1:29:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:41.09,1:29:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:43.23,1:29:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以找你商量嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:45.36,1:29:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:46.43,1:29:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那进来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:48.43,1:29:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:49.77,1:29:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:52.44,1:29:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:54.57,1:29:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:57.24,1:29:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:02.05,1:30:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道怎么办了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:05.12,1:30:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是难办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:08.59,1:30:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:15.13,1:30:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道怎么办了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:23.54,1:30:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有茶可以喝了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:27.67,1:30:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:32.75,1:30:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么丧气嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:36.08,1:30:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都还年轻呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:38.48,1:30:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后还有机会呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:43.42,1:30:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:45.16,1:30:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本你觉得可以的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:48.09,1:30:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要和我交往吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:53.70,1:30:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:55.70,1:30:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出轨的事真是抱歉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:58.24,1:30:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没件么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:01.44,1:31:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下次会注意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:09.58,1:31:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:11.85,1:31:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直聊你的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:15.46,1:31:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:17.46,1:31:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不知所措了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:19.46,1:31:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太入迷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:22.13,1:31:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:24.80,1:31:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后别说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:27.20,1:31:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点打扰你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:40.55,1:31:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝茶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:52.69,1:31:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都这么对她了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:55.36,1:31:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为什么就不理解我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:00.17,1:32:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我年轻时也这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:03.10,1:32:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人和女人想法不一样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:10.84,1:32:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本你有出轨过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:13.91,1:32:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:16.45,1:32:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:18.85,1:32:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有出轨啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:21.52,1:32:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们吵架的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:24.46,1:32:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对别的女人没兴趣吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:29.93,1:32:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是那种人啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:35.00,1:32:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是出轨也是人生经验啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:42.34,1:32:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:48.35,1:32:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:57.16,1:32:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:58.36,1:32:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没弄湿吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:59.69,1:33:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:02.50,1:33:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像弄湿了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:49.34,1:33:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:52.15,1:33:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:56.82,1:33:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去换一杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:58.55,1:34:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:10.56,1:34:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:14.17,1:34:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:18.17,1:34:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:22.04,1:34:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情都过去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:40.46,1:34:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:29.98,1:35:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:37.98,1:35:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没关系了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:04.81,1:36:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你添了那么多麻烦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:07.75,1:36:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我给你按摩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:09.35,1:36:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:11.75,1:36:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀的确酸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:13.89,1:36:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做家务很辛苦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:16.82,1:36:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坐吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:18.42,1:36:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我技术很好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:19.89,1:36:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:23.63,1:36:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:33.91,1:36:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀很酸吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:35.64,1:36:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:37.51,1:36:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:39.38,1:36:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我按摩舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:44.05,1:36:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术很棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:45.92,1:36:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:47.52,1:36:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服得想睡觉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:55.93,1:36:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也很不错呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:00.73,1:37:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩膀很酸吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:07.41,1:37:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里很僵硬呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:10.08,1:37:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:15.95,1:37:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔按摩还挺不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:17.68,1:37:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:19.02,1:37:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:24.09,1:37:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好轻松啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:31.30,1:37:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:44.91,1:37:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
